bio:
Effing Forest, meet near the We Shall Boogie bar, Sat, 9:00-11:00

Start the day right with Little Wildlings — a joyful Forest School type adventure for families with young children. Join us early on Saturday morning next to the We Shall Boogie bar in Effing Forest for two hours of wild play, including mud kitchens and potion labs, bug hunting, nature crafts and storytelling. It’s the perfect way to begin your festival day – playful, curious, and a little bit wild. Dorset Rewilding are a nature-based education provider, connecting people with nature and their wild side!

